<h3 id="customize-the-appearance">Customize the Appearance</h3>
<p>
	You can fully customize the appearance of the {{ theme.themename }} WP Theme. Go to <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Themes</samp></kbd></kbd> and click on the <kbd>Customize</kbd> button:
</p>
<img class="aligncenter" src="images/customize-theme.png" alt="Customize {{ theme.themename }} WP">
<p>
	The new window appears and you can now customize the appearance of your theme — upload your custom logo, change the base colors, enable/disable theme features, add custom CSS or JavaScript, etc.
</p>
